        "_source" : {
          "id" : "b9338430a03340cd89b55aa920026459",
          "createdAt" : "2025-04-17 17:08:43.610964",
          "updatedAt" : "2025-04-18 11:28:53.23392",
          "pharmacyId" : "e3a04cd97d8c4887977cd0d7f6061eb6",
          "name" : "Vitabiotics Wellwoman Max Capsules (84 Capsules)",
          "categoryId" : "a969ad23369e4e5b80826d55f19150bb",
          "notes" : null,
          "description" : """<div class="ewa-rteLine">
<div id="s-549cecb5-a4f8-41ed-ae70-349b19413e4b" class="shg-c  ">
<div class="shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content">
<div id="s-549cecb5-a4f8-41ed-ae70-349b19413e4b" class="shg-c  ">
<div class="shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content">
<p>Wellwoman Max is the ultimate daily supplement for women. A comprehensive 3-in-1 multivitamin triple pack with all round support for key areas of health such as energy, immune system, hormone levels and bone health. Wellwoman is also the UK&rsquo;s No.1 women&rsquo;s supplement brand.</p>
<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
<ul class="expandable__content__productlist">
<li>Energy - with Vitamins B6 and B12 which contribute to normal energy release</li>
<li>Immune system - with Vitamins C and D which contribute to normal immune system function</li>
<li>Regulation of hormonal activity - provides Vitamin B6 which contributes to the regulation of hormonal activity</li>
<li>Bone Health - contains Calcium and Vitamin D which contribute to the maintenance of normal bones</li>
<li>Suitable for vegetarians</li>
<li>No preservatives, yeast, lactose or gluten</li>
<li>Wellwoman is not tested on animals</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>
<p>Bulking agents: microcrystalline cellulose, starch (pregelatinised maize starch) &amp; potato starch, magnesium oxide, vitamin c (ascorbic acid), tablet coating (hydroxypropylmethylcellulose, polydextrose, talc, medium chain triglyceride, colours [iron oxides &amp; calcium carbonate]), l-carnitine tartrate, niacin (as nicotinamide), ferrous fumarate, zinc sulphate, l-methionine, n-acetyl cysteine, vitamin e (d alpha tocopheryl acid succinate) (from&nbsp;<strong>soya),</strong> anti-caking agents: magnesium stearate, stearic acid, silicon dioxide &amp; purified talc, polyvinylpolypyrrolidone, guarana extract, thiamin (vitamin b1 as mononitrate), citrus bioflavonoids, ethyl cellulose, vitamin b6 (pyridoxine hcl), betacarotene, pantothenic acid (as calcium salt), vitamin d3 (cholecalciferol), manganese sulphate, vitamin b12 (cyanocobalamin), riboflavin, green tea extract, copper sulphate, vitamin k1 (phytomenadione), coenzyme q10, folic acid (as pteroylmonoglutamic acid), chromium trichloride, sodium selenate, potassium iodide, biotin.</p>
<p><strong>Dosage</strong>:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>1 max tablet (purple blister), plus 1 omega 3-6-9 capsule (green blister, plus one calcium tablet (blue blister), per day</li>
<li>Swallow each with water or a cold drink and take with a main meal</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Caution:&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Not to be chewed</li>
<li>Do not exceed the recommended intake</li>
<li>To be taken on a full stomach</li>
<li>This comprehensive formula replaces other Wellwoman supplements &amp; multivitamins. There is no need to take an additional multivitamin</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>""",
